*Unlike the first five [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]], Silver Nyanko Ranger and [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Gold Nyanko Ranger]] channel the souls of canids (tanuki and fox, respectively) rather than felids. This may be because they start as the enemies [[Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger]], and many other enemies are dogs.

